  "body": "Auction: 62 Highbrook Drive, East Tamaki on Tuesday 3 November 2026 at 1:00PM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nNewly Renovated Family Haven on 607m² (mol) | The Ultimate Family & Investment Package!\r\n\r\nUnbeatable Macleans Zone Location at the Heart of 3 Top Schools.\r\n\r\nPositioned right in the heart of Bucklands Beach, 231 Bucklands Beach Road offers the perfect blend of modern family living, educational excellence, and outstanding future investment potential on a generous 607m² (approx.) flat section.\r\n\r\nRecently renovated to perfection, this warm and welcoming four-bedroom, two-bathroom family home is ready for you to simply move in and enjoy. Step inside to discover a fresh, stylish interior complete with brand-new carpet throughout, a crisp neutral paint palette, modern downlighting, a dedicated separate sitting room, and a practical separate laundry. The spacious layout includes a luxurious master suite with its own private ensuite.\r\n\r\nUNBEATABLE EDUCATIONAL & COMMUNITY LOCATION\r\nForget the stress of the morning school rush! You are within easy walking distance to all three top-tier schools: Pigeon Mountain Primary, Bucklands Beach Intermediate, and Macleans College. Everyday essentials are right at your doorstep with local dairies, bakeries, takeaways, tennis courts, and nearby parks all just a short stroll away.\r\n\r\nCOASTAL LIFESTYLE MEETS MAXIMUM CONVENIENCE\r\nEmbrace the famous Bucklands Beach Peninsula lifestyle. Spend your weekends walking along local beaches, enjoying nearby parks, or playing a round at the Howick Golf Club. Public transport is effortless with nearby bus stops and convenient ferry links to the city from Half Moon Bay.\r\n\r\nSPACE TO PLAY & ROOM TO GROW\r\nOutdoors, the expansive, flat family garden offers traditional Kiwi lifestyle values that are increasingly rare to find—a safe haven for children and pets to play, and a wonderful backdrop for outdoor entertaining. With 607m² (mol) of land, it also represents a secure, high-value landholding for future growth and development return.\r\n\r\nWhether you are looking for an exceptional home to raise your family in the best school zones, or a smart, long-term investment with secure capital growth, this property delivers on every level.\r\n\r\nThe owners have decided to move on, and it’s your opportunity to take over!\r\n\r\nCall now on to arrange a private viewing or visit our open home to get one step ahead! \r\n\r\nwww.barfoot.co.nz/935553",
